# Altium Designer: the binary documents in Git LFS, lockable (they never merge: git lfs lock before editing one); the
# variants file is an OLE compound file like them. The project and the OutJob are text that Altium writes with CRLF
# (the .PrjPcb with a UTF-8 BOM): -text keeps them byte-exact between Windows and a Mac.
*.SchDoc filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text lockable
*.PcbDoc filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text lockable
*.SchLib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text lockable
*.PcbLib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text lockable
*.IntLib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text lockable
*.Harness filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text lockable
*.PrjPcbVariants filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text lockable
*.PrjPcb -text
*.OutJob -text
